But I just wanna also shout out that even if you conceived of yourself as like fifth guy party guy, you know, one thing that I really loved that because we got so long to do it that Craig and Carter did, they gave me some like insane animated shit to do, but they also gave you some real heart forward stuff that was just as moving as any other characters, as you get deeper in with your father issues with, we just look at the episode, oh no, is this?
