one season and I was like the David Hyde Piercy kind of afraid of germs and an uptight guy and so that was fun but sort of very singular but I had never really done a lot of the big comedy stuff so I had mostly done like Dewey Houser was super sincere and a lot of television movies that had been like I was grounded in sincerity.
